<title>JAPAN: Alpine Electronics - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Alpine Electronics - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		155.37		vs	  125.38</p>
<p> Operating	    5.71		vs	    4.66</p>
<p> Current		6.50		vs	    2.24</p>
<p> Net		     3.4		vs	  800    million</p>
<p> EPS		   62.04 yen	  vs	   16.03 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 57.22 yen	  vs	   13.21 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Alpine Electronics Inc makes car audio equipment and is affiliated with Alps Electric Co Ltd.</p>
